    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713210/extras/2a029ba33fc29670181dd4837fc37229.poster.avif?t=1753766417\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713210/extras/2a029ba33fc29670181dd4837fc37229.webm?t=1753766417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713210/extras/2a029ba33fc29670181dd4837fc37229.mp4?t=1753766417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Battle Shadow Arena</strong> is a 1v1 boss battle action game that blends Souls-like intensity, tactical combo customization, and strategic resource management. If you're drawn to challenging combat and building your own fighting style, this game was made for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Precision Combat System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 4 weapon types: one-handed sword, dual swords, greatsword, and spear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has 12 standard attacks and 48 elemental skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build unique combos using elemental attributes: Water, Wind, Earth, and Fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger counterattacks and special effects through perfect guards and elemental runes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against 16 unique bosses in intense, one-on-one battles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Growth and Customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip over 60 passive skills and create up to 5 customizable presets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance key stats: ATK, HP, DP, EP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock bonus effects with perfect guards and elemental synergy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch elements and summon shadow allies to adapt in real-time combat</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deck-Building with Battle Cards</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and equip 25 powerful battle cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically choose cards for recovery, buffs, and high-impact attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use CP (Card Points) to manage card timing and impact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards expand your active skillset, offering versatile build paths</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713210/extras/53544f726f7c187ff662dfa2da84274b.poster.avif?t=1753766417\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713210/extras/53544f726f7c187ff662dfa2da84274b.webm?t=1753766417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713210/extras/53544f726f7c187ff662dfa2da84274b.mp4?t=1753766417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A Dark Arena of Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warrior awakens in the darkness and fights repeatedly to recover lost memories. As you pass through various atmospheric battle maps\u2014such as coliseums, underground prisons, and noble banquet halls\u2014you\u2019ll uncover fragments of the past through short, subtitled inner monologues. There are no clear answers\u2014only scattered memories hidden in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your combos. Time your guards. Turn the tide of battle.</strong><br>Find your truth in the arena\u2014and shape your own path to victory.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713210/extras/2a029ba33fc29670181dd4837fc37229.poster.avif?t=1753766417\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713210/extras/2a029ba33fc29670181dd4837fc37229.webm?t=1753766417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713210/extras/2a029ba33fc29670181dd4837fc37229.mp4?t=1753766417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Battle Shadow Arena</strong> is a 1v1 boss battle action game that blends Souls-like intensity, tactical combo customization, and strategic resource management. If you're drawn to challenging combat and building your own fighting style, this game was made for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Precision Combat System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 4 weapon types: one-handed sword, dual swords, greatsword, and spear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has 12 standard attacks and 48 elemental skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build unique combos using elemental attributes: Water, Wind, Earth, and Fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger counterattacks and special effects through perfect guards and elemental runes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against 16 unique bosses in intense, one-on-one battles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Growth and Customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip over 60 passive skills and create up to 5 customizable presets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance key stats: ATK, HP, DP, EP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock bonus effects with perfect guards and elemental synergy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch elements and summon shadow allies to adapt in real-time combat</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deck-Building with Battle Cards</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and equip 25 powerful battle cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically choose cards for recovery, buffs, and high-impact attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use CP (Card Points) to manage card timing and impact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards expand your active skillset, offering versatile build paths</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713210/extras/53544f726f7c187ff662dfa2da84274b.poster.avif?t=1753766417\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713210/extras/53544f726f7c187ff662dfa2da84274b.webm?t=1753766417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713210/extras/53544f726f7c187ff662dfa2da84274b.mp4?t=1753766417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A Dark Arena of Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warrior awakens in the darkness and fights repeatedly to recover lost memories. As you pass through various atmospheric battle maps\u2014such as coliseums, underground prisons, and noble banquet halls\u2014you\u2019ll uncover fragments of the past through short, subtitled inner monologues. There are no clear answers\u2014only scattered memories hidden in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your combos. Time your guards. Turn the tide of battle.</strong><br>Find your truth in the arena\u2014and shape your own path to victory.</p>",
